ng>A festival village with its own rhythm, routines, and traps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pattern-reading mechanics: learn each relative's route before they learn yours</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A full cast of hosts, aunts, performers, and the family djinn, each with their own agenda</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A black cat companion who knows the house better than the relatives do</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawn from Arabic family life, written for anyone who has ever hidden in a bathroom to avoid a conversation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <i>azooma</i> is supposed to be an honour. Tonight, it is a tactical problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perfect for stealth fans, cultural comedy lovers, and anyone who’s ever hidden just to avoid a chatty relative.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/bdc398c51a2d8bae983897b07d588c47.poster.avif?t=1781179793\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/extras/bdc398c51a2d8bae983897b07d588c47.webm?t=1781179793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A reverse-stealth comedy where the threat isn't guards with flashlights, but family. Sneak out of your uncle's gathering before the aunts corner you about your grades, the hosts force-feed you, or the family djinn drags you back for one more round of tea.", "supported_languages": "English, Arabic, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896760/a7bf5fd85472d9ed2132a77140290d47c